sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student
  participant M as Mobile app
  participant API as Backend API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant FS as File storage
  participant Q as Job queue
  actor T as Teacher
  actor P as Parent
  S->>M: Open assignment and attach file
  M->>API: POST /files/upload-url
  API-->>M: Signed upload URL
  M->>FS: PUT file
  M->>API: POST /assessments/{id}/submissions
  API->>API: Check JWT, role, school, enrollment, due date
  API->>DB: Insert submission and answers
  API-->>M: 201 Created
  T->>API: POST /submissions/{id}/grade (scores, feedback)
  API->>DB: Save grade and answer scores
  API->>Q: Enqueue recalculate skill scores
  Q->>DB: Update student_skill_scores
  T->>API: POST /assessments/{id}/release
  API->>DB: Mark results released
  API->>Q: Enqueue notifications
  Q-->>S: Push: result available
  Q-->>P: Push: child's result available
